  "version": 1,
  "nba_api_version": "1.11.4",
  "principles": [
    "Regular season and playoffs are collected separately.",
    "Direct NBA fields and transparent formulas may populate terminal metrics.",
    "Context-filtered result sets must preserve their selector in provenance.",
    "Candidate mappings requiring definition review never auto-populate production fields.",
    "Proprietary third-party metrics are not relabeled from NBA API fields."
